open NumberField
open GlobalTheory GlobalTheory.PELU GlobalTheory.UPel.HT GlobalTheory.LKTrip GlobalTheory.LKRes GlobalTheory.LKMid GlobalTheory.LKGeo UpperTheory.Gal.W2.Wit
